1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,528
The second law can be stated three equivalent ways.

2
00:00:03,528 --> 00:00:09,674
In any spontaneous process, the total entropy of the universe increases.

3
00:00:09,674 --> 00:00:14,309
Heat cannot flow by itself from a colder body to a hotter one.

4
00:00:14,309 --> 00:00:22,539
And no engine working in a cycle can convert heat completely into work, without rejecting some to a colder place.

